    },
    "journal": "BusinessActionJournal(path,names,application_protection=True); bind_request(binding). Default construction remains native.",
    "operation": "operation_id,tool,args,target; retry=never|no_effect; depends_on optional. Application targets require exact item_key,quantity,destination,packing. complete_label uses args={} and reservation_from=<query op>; dynamic ID only from matching real owner query. Optional precondition={query_operation_id,status,label_status}. Generic synthetic effects require explicit effect_contract status mapping.",
    "recovery": "Pending original/exception retained; separate _application.recoveries entry records real application-origin query, raw ToolMessage and observed effect. Error ToolMessage paired with original call explicitly displays UNKNOWN, application query and real query receipt. No synthetic checkpoint AI/no Host capacity increment; Host continues and writes through existing tools.",
    "identity": "Binding hash is per public message; task/op semantics compare canonical JSON across messages; reads may repeat; new task/op may execute same parameters."
  },
